{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d23afe2a06cc7f06f6335ca3166c96faed0601875e4c4daf83e66ad834c207d1", "ja": "『アイフェス』に向けて、39プロジェクト\nのアイドル達は、会場の下見をして気合いを\nいれる。全体練習ではお互いに意見を出し合\nい、たくさんの人に感謝を届けるため最高の\nパフォーマンスを追求していく。", "zh": "面向“偶像祭”，39 Project\n的偶像们视察了演出场地，鼓足了干劲。\n在全体练习中，大家互相交换意见，\n为了向更多人传达感谢之情，\n不断追求着最棒的舞台表现。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1fdef7797c54fb7c942123858bcdf209ebb5d1c8e511e6f37cb68ce6436456d0", "ja": "（39人で挑んだ『アイフェス』のライブは大成功！\nこの熱気、しばらく冷めそうもないな！）", "zh": "（由39人共同挑战的『偶像祭典』演唱会大获成功！这股热潮，看来暂时还不会消退啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "16e686fc81b8f0bf5e1c881e411a03c4b776b8699d95c54f718e52e9ea4e8167", "ja": "みなさーん、劇場にも遊びにきてくださいねー！\nありがとうございましたー！！", "zh": "大家——也要来剧场玩哦——！\n非常感谢大家——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1002_se", "source_sha256": "1e59bf4307a0a545bedb644043f1f7e99ea68c1b2103f3604145d8afd5168a57", "ja": "ワアアアアッ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "211ed95e954110e63ead3800354799b0249d40477c29a4fddad92e3a99e3cf9e", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまでーす！\nすっごく、すーっごく、楽しかったです♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦啦——！\n真的、超～级开心的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1004_p", "source_sha256": "6bb802021605b6437783edb33c103ff4bfe86d5ce6207e2a19164740ee6df045", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま！\n本当に、最高のステージだったぞ！", "zh": "大家，辛苦了！\n真的带来了一场最棒的舞台表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c6b00e381ad0f6ee7d0f05c189f58cc80030a2edb3703c073a298ed4b78c2075", "ja": "ねぇねぇ、{$P$}さん～！\n私もいっぱい頑張ったんですよ～。ほめてほめて～♪", "zh": "喂喂，{$P$}先生～！\n我也努力了好多哦～快夸夸我～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "9937c914be994a407f0cfee0d22c279009738a6c363da1ee5af247cb6fd34827", "ja": "もう、翼ってば。{$P$}じゃなくて、\nファンのみんなに褒めてもらわなくちゃダメなのに。", "zh": "真是的，翼真是拿你没办法。明明不是该找{$P$}，\n而是要得到各位粉丝的夸奖才行呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1007_p", "source_sha256": "7051d61cdde52f345a3cacd7d7b27a70c9f1985d7c4b3b6bd3c252a29612f559", "ja": "ファンのみんなも、たくさん褒めてくれたじゃないか。\nそれとも静香は、まだ足りないのか？", "zh": "粉丝们也夸了你很多啊。  \n还是说静香觉得还不够？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "58bf0d710a90cdbf69ef733492a7012a6714eafc309bf8260737700651609b4c", "ja": "わ～、静香ちゃんってば、よくばり～♪", "zh": "哇～，静香真是贪心呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "9e1d5fbd3732691773bb05a92c822e50d7bf39b434574999916ac2bedea36903", "ja": "なっ。わ、私も別に、満足してないわけじゃ……", "zh": "才、才不是。我也不是不满足……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "a02e81f348aa2492a8344d84ea655aa673fcbdd225e2fd4bbdb2ec82b9085b87", "ja": "え～、私は全然満足してないよ？", "zh": "诶～我完全没有满足哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "d18d0b9bc029314b50384e851c08150d63586d16ffa58639242642956495deb7", "ja": "だって本っ当～～に、楽しかったんだもん！\nこういうの、もっとしたい！　もっと、もーっと！", "zh": "因为真的～～特别开心嘛！\n我还想多做几次这样的事！更多、更多——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "b388d17dc8139a81d4c4602a2a8dccc1606cf104f10ac807da84e8576aa405c0", "ja": "未来……。", "zh": "未来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "2b1f98c39bb06a3f6899070cb1b5919915ff55366996c5cf0162e48f6677f908", "ja": "でも静香ちゃんは、もういいの？", "zh": "可是静香，你已经满足了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "94a3106e70b09f56cdeece7ded8452f8cd4c4977e9fc4634df41ffe45f2cf0fb", "ja": "よくないっ。そういう意味なら……私だって。\n{$P$}、まだ全然足りませんからね！", "zh": "才不好。要是那个意思的话……我也一样。\n{$P$}，我还完全没唱够呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a3fa6b7095ff9706687603e50bdda4753b0a9cdbd7db23e2dc7f57c12ab30329", "ja": "あはっ、二人とも気が早いな～♪　ライブが終った\nばっかりなのに。ね、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "啊哈，你们两个也太心急啦～♪明明演出才刚\n结束呢。对吧，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1018_p", "source_sha256": "2e20d478ff7208a649f6537f982af657fbb7a0dfd07995f1a506d34c1e524211", "ja": "はは、そうだな。まあ、盛り上がる気持ちもわかるけど\n……とりあえず、着替えてこようか。", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。虽然我也明白你们兴奋的心情……总之，先去换衣服吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "是──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55", "ja": "はい。", "zh": "是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8a095ebfde003184556c431ec1e1cc4dd0d964a1b0789fcffdf19cca767097b1", "ja": "は～い。", "zh": "好～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1022_014mir", "source_sha256": "8e705db429d0fd2d4ab83ce31c6118df813bfd34b4d875b477270f9eeb66911a", "ja": "思い出しました！　{$P$}さん！", "zh": "我想起来了！{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1023_p", "source_sha256": "2fe5fd9206df6aa2097d7b2a96b14a698766024c5f82ab4a26c00420bfbf9c55", "ja": "うわっ。どうしたんだ、未来？", "zh": "哇，怎么了，未来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1024_014mir", "source_sha256": "ff84a43344b0571003242fe863e91b6aa24c776bb82ebf2fb463980005082951", "ja": "ステージから帰る時に、ファンの人がいっぱい、\n「ありがとう」って言ってくれたんですけど……。", "zh": "下台回去的时候，有好多粉丝对我们说“谢谢”，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1025_014mir", "source_sha256": "f247759308f9bebfca9cedab859bbc6c7ba859eafc1a6d5fda3ed0fbfad56247", "ja": "ステージでお礼を言いたかったの、私たちですよね？\nもしかして、伝わらなかったのかなーって思って……。", "zh": "在舞台上想向大家道谢的，应该是我们吧？\n我就在想，会不会我们的心意没能传达出去呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1026_p", "source_sha256": "918769af2d184a09d3527b9f014466ab313061624a4a9f9fb18a0678449b61bb", "ja": "それは……伝わったからこそだと思うよ。\nありがとうって言ってくれて、ありがとうって。", "zh": "那是因为传达到了，我想……  \n谢谢你对我说了“谢谢”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1027_014mir", "source_sha256": "a83f35cc0ac3ea9a1c24ddbdd4a2a2792bdf16a6d1cc31e2cb08fdd71a3aec0d", "ja": "ありがとうを、ありがとう……。", "zh": "感谢这份“谢谢”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1028_014mir", "source_sha256": "6c16289ea6ba74a13ec6bfccd5e5f0d5c4b8f995336d14d37b84a3fd64cbfbdb", "ja": "そっか！　ありがとうのお返しは、ありがとう！\nなんですね！　なんか私、わかった気がします♪", "zh": "这样啊！“谢谢”的回礼就是“谢谢”！\n我好像有点明白了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1029_016tsu", "source_sha256": "601d98a51dfdd91a0f92fc0663cd499d0d2a9ceade6449f3944357df2f0bb1bf", "ja": "何してるの、未来～！\nみんな待ってるよ～！　早く早く～！", "zh": "你在干什么呀，未来～！\n大家都在等你呢～！快点快点～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1030_014mir", "source_sha256": "07dffb3f5a0cb631e332d913009b67360b6be6af7e75745f6f1221a6fa7d5009", "ja": "みんな……？　ああっ、そうだった！", "zh": "大家……？啊，对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1031_p", "source_sha256": "502003443ef1e25eedf698b3ae03c969903cbdb988387ea54de88caa857475e8", "ja": "ん？　どうした？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1032_014mir", "source_sha256": "307b497284b1cfd69773bab12f34ac901788f80a65f227e109fd2951e5d173ac", "ja": "実は……これから「{$P$}さんに\nありがとうパーティー」をするんです♪", "zh": "其实……我们接下来要办一场\n“向{$P$}先生表达感谢的派对”呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1033_015siz", "source_sha256": "3798bb75e8160c5b52815eb92d2ff0acae85c4c58eae049fe8e7319355ae1256", "ja": "感謝をするなら、{$P$}にもって。\n……一応、お世話になっているのは確かですから。", "zh": "要表达感谢的话，也得对{$P$}说才行。\n……不过，确实一直承蒙照顾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_054_1034_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d117833638e284d80376520c4c7838f4f6e2ef8b11e6d66843b4db6612199c84", "ja": "ジュースもお菓子もいっぱいありますよ～。\nケーキも大きいの買っちゃった♪", "zh": "果汁和点心都有很多哦～。\n还买了一个大蛋糕呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
